  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/657/657-14.htm",
  "statuteText": "657:14 Information Furnished. –\n\nThe supervisors of the checklist shall furnish to the town or city clerks upon their request any information relative to persons entitled to vote in their ward or town which may be necessary to enable them to determine the proper ballot, affidavit, and voting instructions to be sent to an absentee voter. Whoever violates any provision of this section shall be guilty of a violation."
